    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0180" n="100" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg100"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Townsend to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-03"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 166.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 165 of
                    November 19 last, I have the honor to inform the Department that, in addition to
                    my personal visit to the minister for foreign, affairs to offer congratulations
                    on the escape of the King from the attempt upon his life, I wrote to the
                    minister to the same effect.</p>
                <p>I have received from the minister for foreign affairs a reply to my letter of
                    congratulation, a copy and translation of which is herewith transmitted.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lawrence
                    Townsend.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d87-a1.xml" xpointer="d87-a1"/>
            </div>
